# steps/named-struct-exec.md §11, slice 4: a Structure formal is not executed yet.  A native call
# passes a value admitted by names whose same-typed fields may be permuted (D-105), and Model's steps
# address Model's slots -- they would write the wrong fields.  Refused in its own words.
Model:
    size_t: v 1U
    v: v + 1U
return
fn: bump (Model: m) int
    m
    return: 0
Model: fresh
int: r bump(fresh)
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: r; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
